The spell-casting monsters are a lot more capable than I thought.  
Did you know that the monsters also cast haste self, and healing?  
There are no messages for that stuff though.  (I think it would be 
fun if there were.)

Also, some monsters have a whole host of cleric spells that I never
see getting cast:

Holding
Wounds  (OK, I saw this once...)
Blindness
Sticks to Snakes (or Ants)
Confusion

We should definitely have more monsters that cast these spells.  So far,
only one type of monster casts these.  Do you know which? 

